  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Empowering to Act for Circular Transition in Plastics in Lao PDR</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Overall Objective. &lt;/strong&gt;Contribute to the green and circular economy in Lao PDR by empowering consumers to create demand for and adopt low-carbon and sustainable consumption and production (SCP) practices in the plastic sector.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Outcome 1. &lt;/strong&gt;Enhanced awareness and capacity of consumers to reduce single-use plastic consumption and take responsibility for circular waste management and recycling. &#xbf; &lt;em&gt;Education and Awareness Raising.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Outcome 2. &lt;/strong&gt;Increased availability of sustainable alternatives to plastic-single use packaging for consumers. &#xbf; &lt;em&gt;Alternative Materials.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Outcome 3. &lt;/strong&gt;Strengthened public sector support for circular plastic transition through sub-national and inclusive multi-stakeholder policy dialogue and evidence generation &#xbf; &lt;em&gt;Contribute to Plastic Platform.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
